      "content": "It sounds like the weight of carrying all those memories and past experiences is becoming unbearable right now. Those feelings of wanting to stop the struggle are a sign of deep exhaustion, not a true desire to vanish. Instead of trying to keep up with the world's frantic pace, maybe you could focus on finding one small, quiet thing that brings you a moment of peace today. Your life has inherent worth, even if the current moment feels invisible.",
      "source": "target",
